==OSCAR Help==
This installation guide is part of the suite of OSCAR help articles. See [[OSCAR 2.0 Help|OSCAR Help]].

== Creating a Profile ==
If you have migrated your data from a previous OSCAR 1.x installation, you may immediately open and use a profile as you did with OSCAR 1.x. (See [[Installing OSCAR 2.0]]). Otherwise when you first open up OSCAR, you will need to create a profile. 

Your data is associated with a profile, you may have multiple profiles, and each may have multiple CPAP devices associated with it. However if you have more than one machine (especially if they are different brands), it is recommended that each machine be in its own profile.

To read more about creating and maintaining profiles, see [[http://www.apneaboard.com/wiki/index.php/OSCAR_Organization_-_Profile_Page OSCAR Profile Page]]

